# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-"
"classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To demonstrate this method, we start by constructing a simple Clifford "
"circuit. Our goal is to be able to detect when certain types of error occur "
"in this circuit, so that we can discard erroneous measurement results. In "
"error detection terminology, this is also known as our payload circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menunjukkan kaedah ini, kita mulakan dengan membina litar Clifford "
"yang mudah. Matlamat kita adalah untuk dapat mengesan apabila jenis ralat "
"tertentu berlaku dalam litar ini, supaya kita boleh membuang keputusan "
"pengukuran yang silap. Dalam terminologi pengesanan ralat, ini juga dikenali"
" sebagai litar muatan kita.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/f8384a7d-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/f8384a7d-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan perkakasan kuantum "
"{#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our goal is to insert a coherent Pauli check into this payload circuit. But "
"before we do that, we separate this circuit into layers. This will be useful"
" later when inserting Pauli gates in between.\n"
msgstr ""
"Matlamat kita adalah untuk memasukkan semakan Pauli koheren ke dalam litar "
"muatan ini. Tetapi sebelum itu, kita bahagikan litar ini kepada lapisan. Ini"
" akan berguna kemudian semasa memasukkan gate Pauli di antara lapisan-"
"lapisan tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/04bb6ea7-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/04bb6ea7-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we are ready to add coherent Pauli checks into the payload circuit. To "
"do this, we need to construct a \"valid check\" and insert it into the "
"circuit. A \"check\" in this case is an operator that is capable of "
"signaling whether an error occurred in the circuit by making a measurement "
"on an ancilla qubit. It is considered a valid check when the additional "
"operators inserted into the quantum circuit don't logically change the "
"original circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini kita sedia untuk menambah semakan Pauli koheren ke dalam litar muatan. "
"Untuk melakukan ini, kita perlu membina \"semakan sah\" dan memasukkannya ke"
" dalam litar. \"Semakan\" dalam kes ini adalah operator yang mampu memberi "
"isyarat sama ada ralat berlaku dalam litar dengan membuat pengukuran pada "
"qubit ancilla. Ia dianggap semakan sah apabila operator tambahan yang "
"dimasukkan ke dalam litar kuantum tidak mengubah litar asal secara logik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This check is capable of detecting types of errors that anticommute with it,"
" and the check will trigger a measurement of $\\ket{1}$ state in the ancilla"
" qubit instead of $\\ket{0}$ through phase kickback. Therefore, we will be "
"able to discard measurements where an error was signaled.\n"
msgstr ""
"Semakan ini mampu mengesan jenis ralat yang antikomut dengannya, dan semakan"
" akan mencetuskan pengukuran keadaan $\\ket{1}$ dalam qubit ancilla dan "
"bukannya $\\ket{0}$ melalui tendangan fasa. Oleh itu, kita akan dapat "
"membuang pengukuran di mana ralat telah diisyaratkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In general, coherent Pauli checks are controlled-Pauli operators inserted "
"into \"wires\" - spacetime locations between gates. The ancilla qubit "
"responsible for signaling the error is the control qubit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara amnya, semakan Pauli koheren adalah operator Pauli-terkawal yang "
"dimasukkan ke dalam \"wayar\" - lokasi ruangmasa di antara gate. Qubit "
"ancilla yang bertanggungjawab memberi isyarat ralat adalah qubit kawalan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Below we construct a valid check for the Clifford circuit we created above. "
"We can demonstrate that this check doesn't change the circuit operation by "
"showing that when these Pauli checks are propagated to the front of the "
"circuit, they cancel each other out. This is easily shown because a Pauli "
"operator through a Clifford gate is another Pauli operator.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di bawah kita membina semakan sah untuk litar Clifford yang kita cipta di "
"atas. Kita boleh menunjukkan bahawa semakan ini tidak mengubah operasi litar"
" dengan membuktikan bahawa apabila semakan Pauli ini disebarkan ke hadapan "
"litar, mereka saling membatalkan antara satu sama lain. Ini mudah "
"ditunjukkan kerana operator Pauli melalui gate Clifford menghasilkan "
"operator Pauli yang lain.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In general, one can use a decoding heuristic as outlined in "
"[[1]](https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.15725) to identify valid checks. For the "
"purposes of our initial example, we can also construct valid checks by using"
" analytical Pauli and Clifford gate multiplication conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara amnya, seseorang boleh menggunakan heuristik penyahkodan seperti yang"
" digariskan dalam [[1]](https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.15725) untuk mengenal "
"pasti semakan sah. Bagi tujuan contoh awal kita, kita juga boleh membina "
"semakan sah menggunakan syarat pendaraban gate Pauli dan Clifford secara "
"analitik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/e1c1e16d-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/e1c1e16d-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/246a42b8-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/246a42b8-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As we can see, we have a valid check, since the inserted Pauli operators "
"simply have the same effect as an identity operator on the circuit. We can "
"now insert these checks into the circuit with an ancilla qubit. This ancilla"
" qubit, or the check qubit, starts in the $\\ket{+}$ state. It includes the "
"controlled versions of the Pauli operations outlined above and is finally "
"measured in the $X$ basis. This check qubit is now capable of capturing "
"errors in the payload circuit without logically altering it. This is because"
" certain types of noise in the payload circuit will modify the state of the "
"check qubit, and it will be measured \"1\" instead of \"0\" in case such an "
"error occurs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang dapat kita lihat, kita mempunyai semakan sah, kerana operator "
"Pauli yang dimasukkan hanya mempunyai kesan yang sama seperti operator "
"identiti pada litar. Kita kini boleh memasukkan semakan ini ke dalam litar "
"dengan qubit ancilla. Qubit ancilla ini, atau qubit semakan, bermula dalam "
"keadaan $\\ket{+}$. Ia memasukkan versi terkawal bagi operasi Pauli yang "
"digariskan di atas dan akhirnya diukur dalam basis $X$. Qubit semakan ini "
"kini mampu menangkap ralat dalam litar muatan tanpa mengubahnya secara "
"logik. Ini kerana jenis hingar tertentu dalam litar muatan akan mengubah "
"keadaan qubit semakan, dan ia akan diukur sebagai \"1\" dan bukannya \"0\" "
"sekiranya ralat sedemikian berlaku.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/52add690-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/52add690-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-"
"primitives}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 3: Jalankan menggunakan Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-"
"qiskit-primitives}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the check qubit is measured in \"0\", we keep that measurement. If it's "
"measured in \"1\", then this means that an error occurred in the payload "
"circuit, and we discard that measurement.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika qubit semakan diukur sebagai \"0\", kita simpan pengukuran tersebut. "
"Jika diukur sebagai \"1\", ini bermakna ralat telah berlaku dalam litar "
"muatan, dan kita buang pengukuran tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that with an ideal simulator, the check qubit won't detect any errors "
"as we will show in the subsequent post-processing section. We now introduce "
"a noise model to the simulation and see how the check qubit captures "
"errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahawa dengan simulator ideal, qubit semakan tidak akan mengesan "
"sebarang ralat seperti yang akan kita tunjukkan dalam bahagian pasca-"
"pemprosesan seterusnya. Kita kini memperkenalkan model hingar kepada "
"simulasi dan melihat bagaimana qubit semakan menangkap ralat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format "
"{#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 4: Proses-pasca dan kembalikan keputusan dalam format klasik yang "
"dikehendaki {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-"
"format}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now retrieve and analyze the results from the Sampler job. We start "
"by plotting results from the noiseless simulation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang boleh ambil semula dan analisis keputusan daripada kerja "
"Sampler. Kita mulakan dengan memplot keputusan daripada simulasi tanpa "
"hingar.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/4741910b-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/4741910b-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As expected, the check qubit doesn't detect any errors. Next, we plot "
"results from the noisy simulation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang dijangkakan, qubit semakan tidak mengesan sebarang ralat. "
"Seterusnya, kita plot keputusan daripada simulasi berhingarkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/51a8f3d9-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/51a8f3d9-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As we can see, some measurements captured the error by flagging the check qubit as \"1\", which are visible in the last four columns. These shots are discarded.\n"
"Note: The ancilla qubit can also introduce new errors to the circuit. To reduce the effect of this, we can insert nested checks with additional ancilla qubits to the quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang dapat kita lihat, beberapa pengukuran telah menangkap ralat dengan menandakan qubit semakan sebagai \"1\", yang kelihatan dalam empat lajur terakhir. Shot-shot ini dibuang.\n"
"Nota: Qubit ancilla juga boleh memperkenalkan ralat baru ke dalam litar. Untuk mengurangkan kesan ini, kita boleh memasukkan semakan bersarang dengan qubit ancilla tambahan ke dalam litar kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"
msgstr "Contoh perkakasan berskala besar {#large-scale-hardware-example}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem-1}"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we demonstrate a significant task for quantum computing algorithms, "
"which is preparing a GHZ state. We will demonstrate how to do this on a real"
" backend using error detection.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita tunjukkan satu tugasan penting untuk algoritma pengkomputeran "
"kuantum, iaitu menyediakan keadaan GHZ. Kita akan tunjukkan cara melakukan "
"ini pada Backend sebenar menggunakan pengesanan ralat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The error detection algorithm for GHZ state preparation respects the "
"hardware topology. We begin by selecting the desired hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma pengesanan ralat untuk penyediaan keadaan GHZ menghormati topologi"
" perkakasan. Kita mulakan dengan memilih perkakasan yang dikehendaki.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A GHZ state on $n$ qubits is defined as\n"
"$$\\lvert \\mathrm{GHZ}_n\\rangle \\;=\\; \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(\\lvert 0\\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\,+\\, \\lvert 1\\rangle^{\\otimes n}\\Big).$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Keadaan GHZ pada $n$ qubit ditakrifkan sebagai\n"
"$$\\lvert \\mathrm{GHZ}_n\\rangle \\;=\\; \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(\\lvert 0\\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\,+\\, \\lvert 1\\rangle^{\\otimes n}\\Big).$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A very naive approach to prepare the GHZ state would be to choose a root "
"qubit with an initial Hadamard gate, which puts the qubit to an equal "
"superposition state, and then to entangle this qubit with every other qubit."
" This is not a good approach, since it requires long-range and deep CNOT "
"interactions. In this tutorial, we will use multiple techniques alongside "
"error detection to reliably prepare the GHZ state on real hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pendekatan yang sangat naif untuk menyediakan keadaan GHZ adalah dengan "
"memilih qubit akar dengan gate Hadamard awal, yang meletakkan qubit ke "
"keadaan superposisi yang sama, kemudian menjalinkan qubit ini dengan setiap "
"qubit lain. Ini bukan pendekatan yang baik, kerana ia memerlukan interaksi "
"CNOT jarak jauh dan mendalam. Dalam tutorial ini, kita akan menggunakan "
"pelbagai teknik bersama pengesanan ralat untuk menyediakan keadaan GHZ "
"secara boleh dipercayai pada perkakasan sebenar.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution-1}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan perkakasan kuantum "
"{#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution-1}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map the GHZ state to hardware {#map-the-ghz-state-to-hardware}"
msgstr ""
"Petakan keadaan GHZ kepada perkakasan {#map-the-ghz-state-to-hardware}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, we search for a root to map the GHZ circuit on hardware. We remove "
"edges/nodes whose CZ errors, measurement errors, and $T_2$ values are worse "
"than the thresholds below. These will not be included in the GHZ circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, kita cari akar untuk memetakan Circuit GHZ pada perkakasan. Kita "
"buang tepi/nod yang ralat CZ, ralat pengukuran, dan nilai $T_2$-nya lebih "
"teruk daripada ambang di bawah. Ini tidak akan dimasukkan dalam Circuit "
"GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using the function below, we construct the GHZ circuit on the chosen "
"hardware starting from the root and using breadth-first search (BFS).\n"
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan fungsi di bawah, kita bina Circuit GHZ pada perkakasan yang "
"dipilih bermula dari akar dan menggunakan carian luas-pertama (BFS).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now repeatedly search for the best root, where the GHZ circuit will "
"originate from.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang berulang kali mencari akar terbaik, tempat Circuit GHZ akan "
"bermula.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now construct the GHZ circuit starting from a specific node - as in, the "
"best root - searching for the shortest depth using breadth-first search.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang bina Circuit GHZ bermula dari nod tertentu — iaitu akar "
"terbaik — mencari kedalaman terpendek menggunakan carian luas-pertama.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We need one final consideration before inserting valid checks. This is "
"related to the concept of \"coverage\", which is a measure of how many of "
"the wires in a quantum circuit a check can cover. With a higher coverage, we"
" can detect errors on a wider part of the circuit. With this measure, we can"
" select among the valid checks with the highest circuit coverage. In other "
"words, we will be using the `weighted_coverage` function to score different "
"checks for the GHZ circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita perlu satu pertimbangan terakhir sebelum memasukkan semakan yang sah. "
"Ini berkaitan dengan konsep \"liputan\", yang merupakan ukuran berapa banyak"
" wayar dalam Circuit kuantum yang boleh dilindungi oleh sebuah semakan. "
"Dengan liputan yang lebih tinggi, kita boleh mengesan ralat pada bahagian "
"Circuit yang lebih luas. Dengan ukuran ini, kita boleh memilih di antara "
"semakan yang sah dengan liputan Circuit tertinggi. Dengan kata lain, kita "
"akan menggunakan fungsi `weighted_coverage` untuk menilai semakan berbeza "
"bagi Circuit GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now insert checks to the GHZ circuit. Finding valid checks is very "
"convenient for the GHZ state, since any two-qubit Pauli $Z$ operator $Z_i "
"Z_j$ acting on any two qubits $i,j$ of the GHZ circuit is a support and "
"therefore a valid check.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita kini boleh memasukkan semakan ke dalam Circuit GHZ. Mencari semakan "
"yang sah sangat mudah untuk keadaan GHZ, kerana mana-mana operator Pauli $Z$"
" dua qubit $Z_i Z_j$ yang bertindak ke atas mana-mana dua qubit $i,j$ dalam "
"Circuit GHZ adalah sokongan dan oleh itu merupakan semakan yang sah.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Also note that the checks in this case are controlled-$Z$ operators "
"neighboring Hadamard gates from the left and right on the ancilla qubit. "
"This is equivalent to a CNOT gate applied to the ancilla qubit. The code "
"below inserts the checks into the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perlu diperhatikan juga bahawa semakan dalam kes ini adalah operator "
"controlled-$Z$ yang bersebelahan dengan gate Hadamard dari kiri dan kanan "
"pada qubit ancilla. Ini bersamaan dengan gate CNOT yang dikenakan pada qubit"
" ancilla. Kod di bawah memasukkan semakan ke dalam Circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now print out the qubits used in the GHZ circuit and the check "
"qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita kini boleh mencetak qubit yang digunakan dalam Circuit GHZ dan qubit "
"semakan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can also print out some error statistics.\n"
msgstr "Kita juga boleh mencetak beberapa statistik ralat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As previously, we can simulate the circuit first in the absence of noise to "
"ensure correctness of the GHZ state preparation circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti sebelumnya, kita boleh mensimulasikan Circuit terlebih dahulu tanpa "
"bunyi untuk memastikan ketepatan Circuit penyediaan keadaan GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/b905e875-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/error-"
"detection/extracted-outputs/b905e875-1.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As expected, the check qubits are measured as all zeros, and we successfully"
" prepared the GHZ state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang dijangkakan, qubit semakan diukur sebagai semua sifar, dan kita"
" berjaya menyediakan keadaan GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-"
"primitives-1}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 3: Jalankan menggunakan Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-"
"qiskit-primitives-1}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we are ready to run the circuit on real hardware and demonstrate how the"
" error detection protocol can capture errors in GHZ state preparation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita dah sedia untuk jalankan Circuit pada perkakasan sebenar dan "
"tunjukkan bagaimana protokol pengesanan ralat boleh menangkap ralat dalam "
"penyediaan keadaan GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We define a helper function to add measurements to the GHZ circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita definisikan fungsi pembantu untuk menambah ukuran pada Circuit GHZ.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
